      "message": "What about:\n\n```\nnext :\u003d m.RenewBefore\nif next \u003c renewJitter {\n  next \u003d 30*24*time.Hour\n}\nreturn min(next, 30*24*time.Hour, notAfter.Sub(notBefore)/3)\n```\n\nIt\u0027d likely to be a foothgun if you were working with extremely short lived certs and set RenewBefore \u003c 1 hour.",
